 enthusiasm and energy to the pitch that is infectious, and we believe he has a bright future ahead of him.\\\"\"}, {\"id\": \"s5\", \"text\": \"Data from reputable football sources, including Transfermarkt and Sofascore, corroborate Mollejo's affiliation with Atlético Madrid.\"}, {\"id\": \"s6\", \"text\": \"According to Transfermarkt, Mollejo has made 23 appearances for the club, scoring 4 goals and providing 2 assists.\"}, {\"id\": \"s7\", \"text\": \"Sofascore, meanwhile, lists Mollejo as a member of Atlético Madrid's first team, with a rating of 6.83 out of 10 based on his performances.\"}, {\"id\": \"s8\", \"text\": \"Mollejo's teammates have also spoken highly of the young player, praising his work ethic and dedication to the team.\"}, {\"id\": \"s9\", \"text\": \"\\\"Víctor is a great guy to have around,\\\" said Atlético Madrid midfielder, Koke.\"}, {\"id\": \"s10\", \"text\": \"\\\"He's always looking to improve and is willing to put in the extra work to get better.\"}, {\"id\": \"s11\", \"text\": \"He's a valuable asset to our team.\\\"\"}, {\"id\": \"s12\", \"text\": \"In addition to his impressive statistics and glowing endorsements from his peers, Mollejo's presence on Atlético Madrid's official website and social media channels further substantiates his status as a member of the team.\"}, {\"id\": \"s13\", \"text\": \"In conclusion, the evidence is clear: Víctor Mollejo is, indeed, a player for Atlético Madrid.\"}, {\"id\": \"s14\", \"text\": \"With his talent, dedication, and enthusiasm, he is sure to be a key player for the club in the years to come.\"}]}"
